    "protected": false,
    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">  <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">Income tax</span> </li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<p class=\"band-eyebrow\">Free calculator</p>\n<h1 class=\"max-w-3xl text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">Australian income tax calculator</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[1.0625rem]\">Type your income and watch the tax come out of it, line by line. Every figure is the ATO&#39;s, for the year you pick — no email, no signup, no catch.</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft mt-4\"> Updated for 2024–25, 2025–26, 2026–27 · verified against <a href=\"https://www.ato.gov.au/tax-rates-and-codes/tax-rates-australian-residents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ato.gov.au</a> on 2026-08-21 · some 2026–27 thresholds are provisional pending ATO indexation </p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"shell mt-8\">\n<div id=\"xyz-island-0\" data-xyz-island=\"TaxCalculator\" data-xyz-props=\"{&quot;defaultFy&quot;:&quot;2026-27&quot;,&quot;defaultIncome&quot;:85000}\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_23rem] lg:gap-12\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\">\n<div class=\"rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-4 sm:px-6\">\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_2l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Your income before tax</label><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$1,635<!-- -->/week</span></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$</span><input id=\"_r1R_2l_\" type=\"text\" inputMode=\"decimal\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)] pl-7 text-right\" placeholder=\"0\" value=\"85,000\"/></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Salary, wages or total business income for the year.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_4l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Financial year</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\"><select id=\"_r1R_4l_\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)]\"><option value=\"2024-25\">2024–25</option><option value=\"2025-26\">2025–26</option><option value=\"2026-27\" selected=\"\">2026–27 (current)</option></select></div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Includes the <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$1,000</span> standard deduction, applied automatically.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_6l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Work-related deductions</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$</span><input id=\"_r1R_6l_\" type=\"text\" inputMode=\"decimal\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)] pl-7 text-right\" placeholder=\"0\" value=\"\"/></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Leave blank to take the <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$1,000</span> standard deduction. Enter more only if you can beat it.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_8l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Residency for tax purposes</label></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\"><select id=\"_r1R_8l_\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)]\"><option value=\"resident\" selected=\"\">Australian resident</option><option value=\"foreign\">Foreign resident</option><option value=\"working-holiday\">Working holiday maker</option></select></div>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Foreign residents pay tax from the first dollar and no Medicare levy.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] py-4 last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"max-w-sm\"><label for=\"_r1R_al_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">I have a HECS-HELP or study loan</label></p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Repayments start at <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$69,528</span> and are marginal — only the income above the threshold counts.</p>\n</div>\n<p><input id=\"_r1R_al_\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 accent-[var(--color-signal)]\"/></div>\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] py-4 last:border-b-0\">\n<div class=\"max-w-sm\"><label for=\"_r1R_cl_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">I have private hospital cover</label></p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Without it, high earners pay the Medicare levy surcharge on top of the levy.</p>\n</div>\n<p><input id=\"_r1R_cl_\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 accent-[var(--color-signal)]\" checked=\"\"/></div>\n<fieldset class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] py-4 last:border-b-0 m-0 p-0\">\n<legend class=\"mb-2 p-0 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Show my numbers</legend>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white p-1\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"flex-1 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[2px] px-3 py-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:bg-[var(--color-paper-sunk)]\">Weekly</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"flex-1 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[2px] px-3 py-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:bg-[var(--color-paper-sunk)]\">Fortnightly</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"flex-1 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[2px] px-3 py-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:bg-[var(--color-paper-sunk)]\">Monthly</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"flex-1 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[2px] px-3 py-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors bg-[var(--color-ink)] font-semibold text-[var(--color-paper)]\">Annually</button></div>\n</fieldset>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\n<div class=\"rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white p-5\">\n<h2 class=\"m-0 font-display text-base font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\">How the scale applies to you</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-4 text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Your top dollar is taxed at<!-- --> <strong class=\"font-mono tabular-nums text-[var(--color-ink)]\">30%</strong>, but across the whole income you pay<!-- --> <strong class=\"font-mono tabular-nums text-[var(--color-ink)]\">20.71%</strong>. Earning a dollar more never leaves you worse off.</p>\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex h-3 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[2px] bg-[var(--color-paper-sunk)]\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Income of $84,000 split across the 2026-27 tax brackets\">\n<div style=\"width:21.666666666666668%;background:#C9D3D0\" class=\"h-full\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:31.9047619047619%;background:#9FB1AE\" class=\"h-full\"></div>\n<div style=\"width:46.42857142857143%;background:#6E8481\" class=\"h-full\"></div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"mt-4 text-[0.8125rem]\">\n<caption class=\"sr-only\">Tax by bracket for <!-- -->2026-27</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Bracket</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Rate</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Your income</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Tax</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"\">\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] font-normal normal-case tracking-normal\">$0<!-- -->–$18,200</th>\n<td class=\"font-mono\">0%</td>\n<td class=\"font-mono\">$18,200</td>\n<td class=\"font-mono font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">$0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"\">\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] font-normal normal-case tracking-normal\">$18,201<!-- -->–$45,000</th>\n<td class=\"font-mono\">15%</td>\n<td class=\"font-mono\">$26,800</td>\n<td class=\"font-mono font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">$4,020</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"\">\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] font-normal normal-case tracking-normal\">$45,001<!-- -->–$135,000</th>\n<td class=\"font-mono\">30%</td>\n<td class=\"font-mono\">$39,000</td>\n<td class=\"font-mono font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">$11,700</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] font-normal normal-case tracking-normal\">$135,001<!-- -->–$190,000</th>\n<td class=\"font-mono\">37%</td>\n<td class=\"font-mono\">$0</td>\n<td class=\"font-mono font-medium \">$0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] font-normal normal-case tracking-normal\">$190,001<!-- -->+</th>\n<td class=\"font-mono\">45%</td>\n<td class=\"font-mono\">$0</td>\n<td class=\"font-mono font-medium \">$0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 lg:sticky lg:top-6 lg:self-start\">\n<div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-paper)]\">Take-home pay</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-paper)]/70\">2026–27 · Annually</span></div>\n<div class=\"tally-print\">\n<div data-tally-line=\"gross\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Gross income</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$85,000</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"deductions\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Less deductions</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">−</span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$1,000</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"taxable\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-paper-sunk)]\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Taxable income</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums font-semibold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$84,000</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"income-tax\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Income tax</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$15,720</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"medicare\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Medicare levy</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$1,680</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"total-tax\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-paper-sunk)]\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Total tax</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums font-semibold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$17,400</span></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-tally-line=\"take-home\" class=\"px-4 py-5\">\n<div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Take-home pay</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 mt-0.5 max-w-[22rem] text-[0.6875rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">What lands in your account across the year, before salary sacrifice.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-11 shrink-0 items-center\"><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums text-[1.75rem] font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$67,600</span></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"sr-only\" aria-live=\"polite\">Take-home pay<!-- -->:<!-- --> <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$67,600</span></p>\n<p class=\"m-0 mt-2 font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$85,000 − $17,400</p>\n<div class=\"mt-4\">\n<div class=\"space-y-3\">\n<p class=\"m-0 rounded-[3px] bg-[var(--color-paper-sunk)] px-3 py-2 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">What changed: on this income you keep<!-- --> <strong class=\"font-mono tabular-nums text-[var(--color-return)]\">$588</strong> <!-- -->more<!-- --> than in <!-- -->2025–26<!-- -->.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/lodge/?income=85000&amp;fy=2026-27\" class=\"block rounded-[4px] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-2.5 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-paper)] no-underline\">Lodge with a registered agent</a></p>\n<p class=\"m-0 text-[0.6875rem] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">An estimate, not tax advice. Your assessment is determined by the ATO.<!-- --> Some 2026–27 thresholds are not yet indexed by the ATO and carry forward from the prior year.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-center text-[0.6875rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Free, no email required. Showing <!-- -->a year<!-- -->.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-testid=\"sticky-result\" class=\"fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-40 border-t border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white/95 backdrop-blur lg:hidden\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[68rem] items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\">\n<p class=\"m-0 truncate text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Take-home pay</p>\n<p class=\"m-0 font-mono text-lg font-bold tabular-nums text-[var(--color-ink)]\">$67,600</p>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"/lodge/\" class=\"shrink-0 rounded-[4px] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-paper)] no-underline\">Lodge</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"h-20 lg:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p><!--astro:end--></div>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"shell mt-8\">\n<p class=\"m-0 max-w-2xl text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"> This is an estimate, not tax advice. It works from the figures you enter and the ATO rates for the year you selected; your actual assessment is determined by the ATO and may differ. We never ask for your tax file number on this site. </p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<div class=\"prose-statement\">\n<h2>What changed on 1 July 2026</h2>\n<p> Two things, and both of them move the number above. The second marginal rate fell from  <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">16%</span> to <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">15%</span>, which is worth exactly  <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-return text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$268</span> a year to anyone with a taxable income at or above  <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$45,000</span>. And ITAA 1997 s 25-130 introduced a  <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$1,000</span> standard deduction for work-related expenses that applies automatically, without receipts. </p>\n<p> Switch the financial year selector to 2025–26 to see the difference on your own income. If you are lodging a return right now, 2025–26 is almost certainly the year you want. </p>\n<h2>How this calculator works out your tax</h2>\n<p> It runs the same five steps the ATO does, in the same order, and the Tally shows each one. Gross income, less deductions, gives taxable income. The tax scale applies to that. Tax offsets — the low income tax offset, and the seniors and pensioners offset if you qualify — come off the income tax, but never off the Medicare levy. Then the levy, the surcharge if it applies, and any compulsory study loan repayment are added back on. </p>\n<p> Expand any line in the Tally to see the arithmetic behind it. Nothing is hidden and nothing is rounded away. </p>\n<h2>What it does not include</h2>\n<ul>\n<li> Salary sacrifice and reportable employer super contributions — use the <a href=\"/calculators/salary-sacrifice-calculator/\">salary sacrifice calculator</a> for those. </li>\n<li> Capital gains — add them with the <a href=\"/calculators/capital-gains-tax-calculator/\">CGT calculator</a> first, then enter the net gain as income here. </li>\n<li> The private health insurance rebate, foreign income offsets, and a spouse&#8217;s unused seniors offset. </li>\n<li> PAYG instalments already paid during the year, which affect your refund but not your tax. </li>\n</ul>\n<p> If any of those apply to you, the estimate here is a floor rather than a final answer, and it is worth having someone look at the whole picture. </p>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n<section class=\"shell mt-20\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-tax-calculator-heading\">\n<h2 id=\"faq-tax-calculator-heading\" class=\"text-2xl\">Questions people actually ask</h2>\n<dl class=\"mt-6 border-t border-rule\">\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">How much tax do I pay on <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$85,000</span> in Australia?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">On a taxable income of <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$85,000</span> in 2026-27 you pay <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$15,720</span> in income tax plus <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$1,680</span> Medicare levy, once the <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$1,000</span> standard deduction is applied — about <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$17,400</span> in total, leaving roughly <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$67,600</span>. Change the income above and every figure updates.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">What are the 2026-27 tax rates?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">Nothing on the first <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$18,200</span>. Then 15% to <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$45,000,</span> 30% to <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$135,000,</span> 37% to <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$190,000</span> and 45% above that. The second rate dropped from 16% to 15% on 1 July 2026, which is worth <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$268</span> a year to anyone earning <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$45,000</span> or more.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Does moving into a higher tax bracket cost me money?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">No. Only the dollars above the threshold are taxed at the higher rate. Earning one dollar more never leaves you with less — the bracket table under the calculator shows exactly which dollars are taxed at which rate.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Is the Medicare levy included?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">Yes. The calculator adds the 2% Medicare levy, applies the low-income reduction where it applies, and adds the Medicare levy surcharge if you have told us you have no private hospital cover and your income is above the threshold.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Do I have to give you my email to see the result?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">No. The calculator is free and ungated. There is no signup, no email capture and no tax file number field anywhere on this site. You only give us your details if you decide to lodge with us.</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"border-b border-rule py-5\">\n<dt class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink\">What is the <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$1,000</span> standard deduction?</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 mt-2 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem] text-ink-soft\">From 1 July 2026, ITAA 1997 s 25-130 lets you claim <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$1,000</span> of work-related expenses without receipts. You get the higher of that or your itemised claim, so it is worth checking whether your real expenses beat it.</dd>\n</p></div>\n</dl>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-20\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl\">Read up first</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 grid list-none gap-4 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n<li class=\"card p-5\">\n<h3 class=\"text-base\"><a href=\"/tax-tips/standard-deduction-1000/\" class=\"text-ink no-underline hover:underline\">The <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$1,000</span> standard deduction: what it is and who it helps</a></h3>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">From 1 July 2026 every Australian taxpayer can claim <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$1,000</span> of work-related expenses without receipts. Here is how it works and when itemising still beats it.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"card p-5\">\n<h3 class=\"text-base\"><a href=\"/tax-tips/what-can-i-claim/\" class=\"text-ink no-underline hover:underline\">What can I claim on tax?</a></h3>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">A plain guide to work-related tax deductions in Australia: what qualifies, what does not, what records you need, and what each claim is actually worth.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"cta-dark\">\n<div class=\"cta-grid\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"band-eyebrow\">Ready to lodge it?</p>\n<h2>A registered agent prepares it, checks it, and lodges it.</h2>\n<p>Most refunds land within two weeks of assessment. The fee is fixed and quoted before we start — nothing is charged until you approve the finished return.</p>\n<div class=\"cta-actions\"> <a href=\"/lodge/\" class=\"btn\">Start your return</a> <a href=\"/pricing/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">See pricing</a> </div>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec\">\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Individual returns from</span><b>$99</b></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Registered tax agent</span><b>26233684</b></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Fixed fee, quoted up front</span><i>included</i></div>\n<div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Fee deductible from refund</span><i>included</i></div>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-20\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl\">Other calculators</h2>\n<p> <a href=\"/calculators/\" class=\"text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">All calculators →</a> </div>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 grid list-none gap-4 p-0 sm:grid-cols-3\">\n<li class=\"card p-5\"> <a href=\"/tax-refund-calculator/\" class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> Tax refund </a>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Estimate your refund by adding the deductions you actually have. Watch the number move as you claim.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"card p-5\"> <a href=\"/calculators/capital-gains-tax-calculator/\" class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> Capital gains </a>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">What you will pay on a share, property or crypto sale — with the 50% discount and any carried-forward losses applied in the right order.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"card p-5\"> <a href=\"/calculators/help-hecs-repayment-calculator/\" class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> HECS-HELP </a>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Your compulsory repayment under the marginal system that replaced the old flat rates on 1 July 2025.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<p><script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/brseeger-cloud/xyz-accounting-assets@main/islands/TaxCalculator.js\" defer></script></p>\n"
